### ========================================
### MÓDULO: AUDATEX — Sync incremental (GATE_HTTP)
### Login dev: admin@rodieja.com / Admin123!
### ========================================

### 0. Login (obtener token)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@rodieja.com",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 1. GET /oportunidades/sync — carga instantánea desde BD
GET http://localhost:8080/api/audatex/oportunidades/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. GET /oportunidades/sync con filtros
GET http://localhost:8080/api/audatex/oportunidades/sync?desde=2026-06-01&hasta=2026-07-06&aseguradora=Qualitas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. POST /oportunidades/sync/incremental — sync 30 días async
POST http://localhost:8080/api/audatex/oportunidades/sync/incremental
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. GET /oportunidades — lectura desde BD (no portal)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/audatex/oportunidades?desde=2026-06-01&hasta=2026-07-06
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. GET /status integración
GET http://localhost:8080/api/audatex/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. SSE deltas (abrir en cliente REST que soporte stream)
# GET http://localhost:8080/api/audatex/oportunidades/sync/stream
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
# Accept: text/event-stream
